1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:05,745
Tonight, the old night train makes its last run.

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:12,440
From the snow,

3
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:15,956
all the way down to the sea.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,090
For 40 years,

5
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,240
it stopped at every small station on the line.

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:25,630
Then came the long tunnel.

7
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:30,840
On the other side, the snow was gone,

8
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:35,503
and the river towns kept their lights on for it.

9
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:40,228
At the end of the line, the ocean was waiting.

10
00:00:41,450 --> 00:00:45,540
One by one, the windows went dark.

11
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:51,000
But the station light stays on, for the next train.
